{"type":"record","name":"GeometryCommand","namespace":"com.optionsedge.contracts.geometry","doc":"An operator command to the geometry signal adapter (LAG-R16.3 / 16.5): actionable lane on/off, close, retry-close, release, clear-contract-failure. Identity of a command is (issuedAtMs, nonce); the adapter admits a repeated identity once. kind is a closed string vocabulary (ACTIONABLE_ON, ACTIONABLE_OFF, OPERATOR_CLOSE, OPERATOR_RETRY_CLOSE, OPERATOR_RELEASE, CLEAR_CONTRACT_FAILURE) because enum additions are prohibited under FULL compatibility. planId is null for the lane commands (ACTIONABLE_ON, ACTIONABLE_OFF, CLEAR_CONTRACT_FAILURE) and names the plan otherwise.","fields":[{"name":"kind","type":"string"},{"name":"planId","type":["null","string"],"default":null},{"name":"nonce","type":"string"},{"name":"issuedAtMs","type":"long"},{"name":"operator","type":"string"}]}